    "rule_id": "INT_PCR_MRP_DECLARATION",
    "rule_reference": "Rule 6(1)(e) & Rule 18(2)",
    "rule_family": "MRP / Retail Sale Price",
    "requirement": "Every retail package must declare the Maximum Retail Price in Indian currency inclusive of all taxes.",
    "description": "Standard formats include: 'MRP Rs. XX.XX (inclusive of all taxes)' or 'MRP Rs. XX.XX incl. of all taxes'. Selling above MRP is strictly illegal. Sticker price alteration is barred, except when reducing prices (revised lower MRP sticker must not obscure the manufacturer's original printed MRP). State Excise rules override for alcoholic beverages. Essential Commodities Act Notifications override standard pricing.",
